1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,960
A Unique Theme Park.
独一无二的主题公园。

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:57,953
As soon as our shuttle got close to the theme park by the freeway, everyone came to life and put on cloth sneakers in advance for an outing. Our translator paid for the admission, and we started enjoying the various attractions in the sunlight. According to the travel brochure, this unique park is famous for its well preserved minority culture.
我们的接驳车一接近主题公园，沿着高速公路而来，大家就活跃起来，提前穿上帆布运动鞋，为出游做准备。翻译替我们付了门票钱，我们开始在阳光下欣赏各种景点。根据旅游宣传册的介绍，这个独特的公园以保存完好的少数民族文化闻名。

3
00:00:57,953 --> 00:01:50,380
We experienced many deeds of the early settlers, such as swinging across rivers, hunting creatures in the jungle, or taking part in sword-fighting tournaments. This park is also famous for its wooden souvenirs. Whichever we bought in the central shop was made of wood, and wherever we went we could see minority carpenters working.
我们体验了早期定居者的许多活动，例如荡过河流，在丛林里打猎，或参加剑术比赛。这座公园还以木制纪念品出名。无论我们在中心商店买哪一件东西，它都是木头做的，而且无论我们走到哪里，都能看见少数民族木匠在工作。

4
00:01:50,380 --> 00:02:31,407
They made wooden tools, wooden cartoon figures, wooden athletic products and so on. They even built a huge wooden engine with a length of 20 metres, which was modeled after a real one. This theme park is really a fantasy amusement park.
他们制作木制工具，木制卡通人物，木制体育用品，等等。他们甚至造了一台长20米的巨大木制发动机，是仿照一台真发动机制作的。这座主题公园真是一个充满奇幻想象的游乐园。

5
00:02:31,407 --> 00:02:39,167
No wonder it has become the brand of local tourism.
难怪它成了当地旅游业的一张名片。
